    <section class="services" id="services">
        <h2 class="heading">Services</h2>

        <div class="services-container">
            <div class="service-box" data-aos="fade-down-right" data-aos-delay="100" data-aos-duration="1000">
                <div class="service-info">
                    <h4>Full Stack .NET Developer</h4>
                    <p>
                        As a dedicated Full Stack .NET Developer, I build powerful, scalable, and secure web applications
                        using modern technologies. With expertise in C#, ASP.NET Core, Entity Framework, and SQL Server
                        on the backend, combined with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and modern frameworks on the frontend,
                        I deliver end-to-end solutions that are both efficient and user-friendly.
                        Whether it's developing a new system from scratch or enhancing existing applications,
                        I ensure clean architecture, optimized performance, and a seamless user experience across all platforms.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-box" data-aos="fade-down-left" data-aos-delay="100" data-aos-duration="1000">
                <div class="service-info">
                    <h4>Problem Solver</h4>
                    <p>
                        I solve problem-solving challenges to improve my programming skills and
                        tackle algorithmic tasks efficiently. I focus on enhancing logical thinking,
                        writing optimized code, and mastering core programming concepts. Whether it's
                        preparing for coding competitions such as ICPC or solving challenging problems,
                        I actively practice and refine my abilities.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-box" data-aos="zoom-out-right" data-aos-delay="100" data-aos-duration="1000">
                <div class="service-info">
                    <h4>Software Engineer</h4>
                    <p>
                        As a passionate Software Engineer, I design and develop reliable, efficient, and scalable software solutions
                        tailored to meet real-world needs. With strong expertise in software development lifecycles, object-oriented programming,
                        and modern frameworks, I build applications that combine clean architecture with high performance.
                        From analyzing requirements and writing robust code to testing and deployment,
                        I ensure delivering solutions that are both user-focused and future-ready.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-box" data-aos="zoom-out-left" data-aos-delay="100" data-aos-duration="1000">
                <div class="service-info">
                    <h4>API Development</h4>
                    <p>
                        I specialize in building robust and scalable RESTful APIs using ASP.NET Core,
                        enabling seamless communication between frontend and backend systems.
                        With a focus on clean architecture, security, and performance,
                        I ensure that applications are well-structured, easy to maintain, and ready for integration
                        with third-party services and client applications.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

   
    @if (TempData["Success"] != null)
